  <p class="body-text">Signature Therapeutic Wellness is committed to ensuring this website is accessible to everyone, including people with disabilities.</p>

  <h2 class="page-section-title" style="margin-top:2.5rem;">Our Approach</h2>
  <p class="body-text">We aim to follow the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 Level AA, including semantic HTML, keyboard-navigable menus, sufficient color contrast, and descriptive alt text for images.</p>

  <h2 class="page-section-title" style="margin-top:2.5rem;">Ongoing Improvements</h2>
  <p class="body-text">Accessibility is an ongoing effort. As we update this site, we review new pages and features for accessibility issues and address them promptly.</p>

  <h2 class="page-section-title" style="margin-top:2.5rem;">Feedback</h2>
  <p class="body-text">If you encounter any barriers using this website, or need assistance accessing information about our services, please contact us — we're happy to help.</p>
